42:48.696 --> 42:51.177
[anggota regu mengerang]

42:51.394 --> 42:53.005
[lentera pecah]

42:53.222 --> 42:55.355
[musik termenung]

42:57.009 --> 43:00.099
[ketukan kuku]

43:00.403 --> 43:01.796
- Pindahkan itu <i>.</i>

43:02.014 --> 43:03.232
Ayo.

43:04.407 --> 43:05.278
[api mendesing]

43:05.539 --> 43:07.628
