48:09.756 --> 48:10.496
- Mm hm.

48:15.327 --> 48:15.936
- Itu saja.

48:19.984 --> 48:23.030
[musik berlanjut]
[denting taji]

48:29.080 --> 48:31.778
[musik berlanjut]

48:31.996 --> 48:33.693
[pintu berderit]

48:36.914 --> 48:39.786
